c4", "type": "concept", "title": "layered pulses"}], "description": "The class analyzes simultaneous rhythmic layers and metric conflicts."}, {"id": "c4c0443f-4b24-4dcc-9346-f3e9fe04fb87", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Rhythmic process", "children": [{"id": "1fd1101a-e2ae-4632-a138-4c487e8e48af", "type": "concept", "title": "additive rhythm"}, {"id": "c4c2ff1a-f686-402c-9cab-11057f24db58", "type": "concept", "title": "augmentation/diminution"}, {"id": "c783c183-5d5f-466e-935c-2c40951545fe", "type": "concept", "title": "phasing preview"}], "description": "Students connect rhythm to form, texture, and perception."}]}, {"id": "042270e5-df13-4666-b3b0-d346e73951c0", "type": "topic", "title": "Minimalism", "description": "Minimalism introduces process, repetition, gradual change, and perceptual listening as analytical foundations.", "children": [{"id": "561fea12-7b3c-4c3a-9f49-31451cd8bf21", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Process and repetition", "children": [{"id": "1e85c022-7567-4ff3-b9d7-a3cd93c13f15", "type": "concept", "title": "ostinato"}, {"id": "5924a36a-3a55-4f02-80e0-114eced080ba", "type": "concept", "title": "looping"}, {"id": "1fc4ec79-be5f-4dec-a752-8cec810fd5ea", "type": "concept", "title": "gradual process"}], "description": "Students analyze how repeated patterns become form."}, {"id": "acbed846-f269-40fe-87e6-db64b6a89076", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Phasing and additive techniques", "children": [{"id": "7ee29b10-af98-46fb-9376-56617babd338", "type": "concept", "title": "phase shifting"}, {"id": "e6510c3d-701e-4478-9565-7338edf1a60f", "type": "concept", "title": "additive process"}, {"id": "3410ff73-2a4e-4343-852f-877ca72d9dee", "type": "concept", "title": "subtractive process"}], "description": "The class studies canonical minimalist procedures."}, {"id": "8fee2f6d-eb46-453f-8129-a4416589d825", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Listening and perception", "children": [{"id": "aa2a722e-8289-4045-b235-9be14e60b718", "type": "concept", "title": "pattern recog